              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A YARA-L rule has no `events` or no `condition` section."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "yaral_section_missing\n\nA YARA-L rule has no events or no condition section.\n\nSeverity: error. Reported by opentide validate (its schema check) on a configurations.google_secops block (yara-l-1.0). A rule needs both: events names what to match, condition when it fires. The finding is on the missing key.\n\nExample\n\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    events: |\n      $e.metadata.event_type = \"NETWORK_DNS\"\n\nHow to fix\n\nAdd the missing key, as a block scalar:\n\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    condition: |\n      $e",
                "markdown": "# yaral_section_missing\n\nA YARA-L rule has no `events` or no `condition` section.\n\nSeverity: error. Reported by `opentide validate` (its `schema` check) on a `configurations.google_secops` block (yara-l-1.0). A rule needs both: `events` names what to match, `condition` when it fires. The finding is on the missing key.\n\n## Example\n\n```yaml\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    events: |\n      $e.metadata.event_type = \"NETWORK_DNS\"\n```\n\n## How to fix\n\nAdd the missing key, as a block scalar:\n\n```yaml\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    condition: |\n      $e\n```\n"
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              }
            },
